## Recommended Response Actions

1. Isolate host **Andrew** from the network
2. Capture memory and disk images for forensics
3. Block `cleanpatron.top` at DNS and email gateway
4. Reset credentials for any accounts used on the host
5. Search email logs for other recipients of the same campaign
6. Check browser history for the phishing URL
